<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 5.99 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 5.99 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 5.99 percent on Wednesday from 6.15 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said two banks traded in seven reported transactions worth 9.7 million dinars ($13.7 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
